ype":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"`Vim` で面倒くさいのは吸収できるので","ts":"1622209196.157700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qxnvh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d35882e-1a57-4976-b8ae-680ce026129e","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"ただまぁ `Denops` は生側なので、煩雑になる分には許容です","ts":"1622209185.157200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L0w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c5daa23-9450-46ab-8655-e9c2a2b2d921","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"テストのためにユーザーに面倒臭さとか危険とかをあんまり露出したくないなーという感じです","ts":"1622209156.156700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n2m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d08da184-b677-40ed-8080-fb6b72c8988b","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"自分もちょっとイジイジしてみます","ts":"1622209115.155900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"bow","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0p1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4becc916-a53a-4b4c-9ccd-c6ad2a5da3a2","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ですよね","ts":"1622209106.155500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bXlV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"de134e3b-50d5-4c4e-88c0-aed2d86b88b9","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"んーごめんなさい。腰据えて考えないと結論出そうにないです","ts":"1622209099.155300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nD=dF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"96f10674-fd1d-440a-b06a-7db8f33b284c","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"いや、微妙....","ts":"1622209088.154900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"unG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dfaf2ddd-ca00-4b63-8ff2-2271ef1268e0","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"コンストラクタで listen 開始しちゃって","ts":"1622209067.154400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SzK/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6b9e414-85c4-4b6c-b5d1-bd0d8df52338","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"```Error: Failed to call 'call' with [\"bufadd\",\"denops\"]: [0,\"Invalid method: call\"]```","ts":"1622209064.154200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5sl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"36306ed1-8484-43ec-9287-052f174b14c1","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"listenができればと思って↓のように書き換えてみたけど、テストでinvalid methodが出てしまった…\n```diff --git a/denops/@denops/denops.ts b/denops/@denops/denops.ts\nindex d01b8ac..1a2fc57 100644\n--- a/denops/@denops/denops.ts\n+++ b/denops/@denops/denops.ts\n@@ -62,9 +62,17 @@ export class Denops {\n    */\n   static start(init: (denops: Denops) =\u0026gt; Promise\u0026lt;void\u0026gt; | void): void {\n     const denops = Denops.get();\n-    const waiter = Promise.all([denops.#session.listen(), init(denops)]);\n+    denops.listen(init);\n+  }\n+\n+  /**\n+   * Listen denops session.\n+   * @param init: An initialization function of.\n+   */\n+  listen(init: (denops: Denops) =\u0026gt; Promise\u0026lt;void\u0026gt; | void): void {\n+    const waiter = Promise.all([this.#session.listen(), init(this)]);\n     waiter.catch((e) =\u0026gt; {\n-      console.error(`Unexpected error occurred in '${denops.name}'`, e);\n+      console.error(`Unexpected error occurred in '${this.name}'`, e);\n     });\n   }\n ```","ts":"1622209052.153800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"87U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"006d694f-da20-4294-8280-7429196d8c7f","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ですよね","ts":"1622208989.153000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wG3i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21d035b0-bba6-4643-9265-6d16eabc0681","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"あまり `#session` は外出ししたくないしなぁ","ts":"1622208985.152800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IoP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"468694d7-98ce-4f99-aabe-0059303ff30d","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"さて、どうしますかねぇ....","ts":"1622208972.152400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PV1g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"04ea3fa2-9c08-483c-a598-741b0c16ca7e","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"あぁ、なるほど","ts":"1622208966.152100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m1we"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8fd4d541-1375-4dbd-a2b1-6412e6cd529b","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"あれ","ts":"1622208924.151900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UygU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9e68b340-a351-4547-8a5e-3af2dd81834e","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"denops、複雑…","ts":"1622208649.151700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QcwOV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6df95c3-ae28-4f23-874b-80a109002eba","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"denops.#session.listen() していないからだと思う","ts":"1622207864.151400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sHz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e7cb343d-8b36-4968-b53a-2cd5f0cc8aa4","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"これ、多分原因わかった\n\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C01N4L5362D/p1622072559139200\u003e","ts":"1622207798.150900","attachments":[{"fallback":"[May 26th, 2021 4:42 PM] sho19921005: 試しに、awaitを使わないで動かしてみたら fn.bufadd Promiseが返ってこないのは確認できた\n```    const denops = new Denops(\"test\", reader, writer);\n    const fn = new FuctionHelper(denops);\n    fn.bufadd(\"denops\").then((bufnr) =\u0026gt; console.log(\"result\", bufnr)).catch((\n      err,\n    ) =\u0026gt; console.log(err));\n\n    await new Promise((resolve) =\u0026gt; setTimeout(resolve, 100 * 1000));```","id":1,"author_id":"UDDCM376D","author_name":"ゴリラ（筋トレ継続中）","author_subname":"ゴリラ（筋トレ継続中）","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/UDDCM376D","author_icon":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2021-01-06/1621211956228_09947ad089d6e790ca09_48.png","text":"試しに、awaitを使わないで動かしてみたら fn.bufadd Promiseが返ってこないのは確認できた\n```    const denops = new Denops(\"test\", reader, writer);\n    const fn = new FuctionHelper(denops);\n    fn.bufadd(\"denops\").then((bufnr) =\u0026gt; console.log(\"result\", bufnr)).catch((\n      err,\n    ) =\u0026gt; console.log(err));\n\n    await new Promise((resolve) =\u0026gt; setTimeout(resolve, 100 * 1000));```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #tech-denops","ts":1622072559.139200,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C01N4L5362D/p1622072559139200","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C01N4L5362D/p1622072559139200"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8s1C"}]}]
